# Pstack model configuration

# defaults: 3

| Pstack role | Task difficulty | Claude Code model and effort |
| --- | --- | --- |
| feature, refactoring | Routine | Sonnet(medium-high) → Opus(medium-high) |
| bug-fix | Routine | Sonnet(medium-high) → Opus(high-xhigh) |
| perf-issue | High | Opus(high-xhigh) |
| hillclimb | High | Opus(medium-high) → Opus(xhigh) |
| judgment and prose | Routine | Haiku(low-medium) → Sonnet(medium-high) |
| arena runners | Low or high | Haiku(medium-high), Opus(medium-high) |
| arena cross-judge pool | Low or high | Haiku(high-xhigh), Opus(high-xhigh) |
| swarm workers | Low | Haiku(low-medium) → Sonnet(medium-high) |
| interrogate reviewers | Low or high | Sonnet(medium-high), Opus(high-xhigh) |

## Codex aliases

| Claude Code model | Codex alias |
| --- | --- |
| Haiku | luna |
| Sonnet | terra |
| Opus | sol |

For native Codex tasks, resolve each alias at runtime to the latest compatible model in that family available to the task tool, and pass the resolved model ID and selected effort separately.
